{{Quote|You are required to maneuver straight down this trench and skim the surface to this point. The target area is only two meters wide. It's a small thermal exhaust port, right below the main port.|Alliance [[General]] [[Jan Dodonna]]|<ref name="ANH" />}}
The '''meridian trench''',<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars">''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]''</ref> sometimes called the '''Polar Trench''', was a trench situated near the north pole of the [[Galactic Empire]]'s [[DS-1 Orbital Battle Station|Death Star]] [[battle station]].<ref name="SWCT">{{SWCT|set=Blueprints|cardname=Death Star}}</ref> It contained its only weakness, the [[thermal exhaust port]]. After the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic]] managed to [[Battle of Scarif|steal]] the [[Death Star plans|plans]] to the Death Star, they discovered that fatal flaw. Consequently, the Alliance decided to send an attack run of [[starfighter]]s down the meridian trench in order to fire a [[proton torpedo]] into the exhaust port, triggering a chain reaction that would cause the Death Star's main [[reactor]] to explode. After navigating his [[T-65B X-wing starfighter]] through the meridian trench, [[Luke Skywalker]] managed to [[Battle of Yavin|destroy]] the battle station as planned.<ref name="ANH" />

